data: {"answer": "這裡是餐飲部的收銀系統區域，主要處理點餐傳送、加密刷卡付款及信用卡資料管理。\n你看到的防護措施包括點對點加密、不儲存安全碼與 PIN，以及卡號遮罩。\n注意別點擊可疑郵件或讓 POS 記憶體側錄惡意程式入侵。", "go": [{"key": "bar", "en": "Bar Inventory & ERP", "zh": "酒吧庫存與 ERP", "base_en": "Bar", "base_zh": "酒吧", "url": "https://livetour.istaging.com/6a1e0bab-b805-4788-935b-97a06a024613?index=4", "tour": "A", "why_en": "Next in the story", "why_zh": "故事的下一站"}], "followups": [{"text": "餐飲收銀系統（POS）是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Point of Sale (POS) do?", "zh": "餐飲收銀系統（POS）是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "釣魚郵件要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent phishing email?", "zh": "釣魚郵件要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 7.96, "total_s": 7.98}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "hall", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "hall"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 7.2}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "hall", "label": "Room", "en": "Restaurant", "zh": "餐廳"}, {"key": "pos", "label": "System", "en": "Point of Sale (POS)", "zh": "餐飲收銀系統（POS）"}, {"key": "pin_pad", "label": "System", "en": "Card Payment Terminal", "zh": "刷卡機"}, {"key": "email", "label": "System", "en": "Email & Collaboration", "zh": "電子郵件與協作平台"}, {"key": "endpoints", "label": "System", "en": "Staff Laptops, PCs & Phones", "zh": "員工筆電、電腦與手機"}, {"key": "kds", "label": "System", "en": "Kitchen Display System", "zh": "廚房出單系統"}, {"key": "phishing", "label": "Threat", "en": "Phishing Email", "zh": "釣魚郵件"}, {"key": "pos_malware", "label": "Threat", "en": "POS Memory-Scraping Malware", "zh": "POS 記憶體側錄惡意程式"}, {"key": "skimming", "label": "Threat", "en": "Card Skimming & Terminal Tampering", "zh": "刷卡機側錄與竄改"}, {"key": "p2pe_tokenization", "label": "Control", "en": "P2PE & Tokenization", "zh": "點對點加密與代碼化"}, {"key": "no_sad_storage", "label": "Control", "en": "Never Store CVV or PIN", "zh": "不儲存安全碼與 PIN"}, {"key": "c_encryption_hashing", "label": "Concept", "en": "Encryption vs Hashing", "zh": "加密與雜湊"}, {"key": "c_pci_scope", "label": "Concept", "en": "Cardholder Data Environment (PCI scope)", "zh": "持卡人資料環境（PCI 範圍）"}, {"key": "c_tokenization", "label": "Concept", "en": "Tokenization", "zh": "代碼化"}], "edges": [{"a": "pos", "t": "SENDS_TO", "b": "kds"}, {"a": "pos", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "pin_pad", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "kds", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "email", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "endpoints", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "phishing", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "endpoints"}, {"a": "phishing", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "email"}, {"a": "phishing", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "pos_malware", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "pos"}, {"a": "pos_malware", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "skimming", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "pin_pad"}, {"a": "skimming", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "c_encryption_hashing", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "c_encryption_hashing", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "p2pe_tokenization"}, {"a": "c_tokenization", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "c_tokenization", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "p2pe_tokenization"}, {"a": "c_pci_scope", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "c_pci_scope", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "p2pe_tokenization"}, {"a": "p2pe_tokenization", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "p2pe_tokenization", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "pin_pad"}, {"a": "p2pe_tokenization", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "pos"}, {"a": "p2pe_tokenization", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "pos_malware"}, {"a": "no_sad_storage", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "hall"}, {"a": "no_sad_storage", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "pos_malware"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：餐廳收銀系統\n這裡講的是：點餐從 POS 送到廚房螢幕，用加密的刷卡機付款；信用卡資料是這裡管得最嚴的資料。\n重點：不能存安全碼和 PIN，卡號要遮罩；收銀電腦上收到奇怪的信先別點。\n在這裡的部門：餐飲部（分機 3100）\n這裡的系統：餐飲收銀系統（POS）、刷卡機、電子郵件與協作平台、員工筆電、電腦與手機、廚房出單系統\n這裡要注意的威脅：釣魚郵件、POS 記憶體側錄惡意程式、刷卡機側錄與竄改\n看得到的防護措施：點對點加密與代碼化、不儲存安全碼與 PIN\n課程概念：加密與雜湊、持卡人資料環境（PCI 範圍）、代碼化\n相關的處理流程：收到可疑郵件、點了釣魚連結或輸入了密碼、刷卡機疑似被動過、收銀系統當機\n可以走到：壁爐近看・點餐平板、酒吧庫存與 ERP、餐廳近看・收銀機、夜晚的餐廳・收銀系統停擺、客人報到與無線網路（導覽裡的名稱：湖畔露台）", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 7.96, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 792, "prompt_s": 2.44, "gen_tokens": 66, "gen_s": 4.6, "tok_per_s": 14.4, "first_token_s": 3.37}}, "state": {}}

